          {
            "title": "Spot an oversized boundary",
            "id": 152127,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Handler erwartet nur einen Text für ungültige Sitzplätze. Welche Arbeit sollte außerhalb dieses übergroßen <code>try</code>-Blocks verschoben werden?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  seats = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = seats * form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_booking(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Gesamtkalkulation und der Aufruf von <code>save_booking()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Umwandlung mit <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Der <code>ValueError</code>-Handler</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Der gesamte Funktionskörper</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Gesamtkalkulation und der Aufruf von <code>save_booking()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Move recovery to the caller",
            "id": 152128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Buchung hat einen Schlüssel <code>\"seats\"</code>, aber sein Text kann ungültig sein. Vervollständige den spezifischen Handler des Aufrufers um <code>parse_seats()</code> herum.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"process_booking\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booking)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    seats = parse_seats(booking[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" seats\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>ValueError</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Separate expected failures",
            "id": 152129,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den ersten Handler, damit ein fehlender Schlüssel <code>\"seats\"</code> seine eigene Antwort erhält.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  seats = int(booking[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>KeyError</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep saving outside",
            "id": 152130,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was kann an der Fehlerbehandlung in diesem Code verbessert werden?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  seats = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_booking(seats)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fange eine bestimmte Ausnahme wie <code>ValueError</code> ab, statt ein einfaches <code>except</code> zu verwenden, und verschiebe <code>save_booking(seats)</code> aus dem <code>try</code>-Block.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Verschiebe <code>save_booking(seats)</code> aus dem <code>try</code>-Block</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fange eine bestimmte Ausnahme ab, zum Beispiel <code>ValueError</code>, anstatt ein nacktes <code>except</code> zu verwenden.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nichts</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fange eine bestimmte Ausnahme wie <code>ValueError</code> ab, statt ein einfaches <code>except</code> zu verwenden, und verschiebe <code>save_booking(seats)</code> aus dem <code>try</code>-Block..</p></body></html>"
          },
