            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Schließe den erwarteten Konvertierungs-Handler des Einstellungs-Laders ab. Der Start bleibt außerhalb des Blocks.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"settings.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"start_service\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(settings)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"88\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>ValueError</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
